day 2020.10

# Joltage adapters: each takes an input 1 to 3 jolts lower than its rating.
# The outlet is 0 jolts and the device is 3 above the highest adapter.
# Part 1: using every adapter in order, the number of 1-jolt differences
#         times the number of 3-jolt differences.
# Part 2: the number of ways to arrange adapters from the outlet to the
#         device.

example """
16
10
15
5
1
11
7
19
6
12
4
"""
  part1 = 35
  part2 = 8

example """
